window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Trust no one, fight for everything. Some things are worth risking eternity for.</b></p> <p>Kalili Keoka thought she’d left the world of cosmic battles and celestial betrayals far behind. But when an unholy alliance of angels and demons erupts onto the scene, old friends Dakota Chase and McKenna Cross are dragged back into the chaos alongside Kalili and her partner Faith—a former angel who’s no stranger to the treacherous games of the immortal realm.</p> <p>Dakota and McKenna, seasoned thieves with a knack for survival, quickly realize that the stakes have never been higher. Valaferion, a ruthless Duke of Hell, and his allies—an archangel, an archdemon, and a deadly principality—are bent on shifting the balance of power forever, and Kalili’s at the center of their plan. As the four friends plunge into battles against impossible odds, they’ll need every skill, every weapon, and every bond of loyalty to survive the onslaught.</p> <p>From gritty city streets to the fiery depths of Hell, their journey is one of relentless action, dangerous secrets, and unwavering friendships.</p> <p>As the final showdown looms, Kalili knows that courage may not be enough to save them—and the price of victory could be far greater than any of them are prepared to pay. <i>Embers of Eternity</i> is a high-stakes, heart-pounding journey where loyalty and love are the ultimate weapons in a world on the edge of ruin.</p>"; 
